"""NeuroChrom-X workflow entry point (PRD sections 7 to 10, ADR-010).

Run from the repository root:

    snakemake -s workflow/Snakefile --cores 4 --software-deployment-method conda \
        --configfile config/config.yaml config/overrides/toy.yaml

Later --configfile files override earlier ones key by key. With no --configfile the
defaults in config/config.yaml are used.
"""

